In this deep-dive, we will enhance our problem-solving toolkit by integrating multimodal and long-context capabilities, and unlock an unprecedented range of new solutions. Step by step, we will architect solutions for four complex challenges:

Multimodal Video Transcription: Transcribe videos and identify speakers in a single prompt.

Knowledge Graph Generation: Extract entities and relationships from massive inputs (1M tokens) with a single request.

Image Bank Automation: Set up a pipeline for consistent image generation and bring your visual archives back to life.

Visual Object Detection & Edition: Identify, restore, and transform elements within your images.','{"id": "aad8961f8f7e403595959cc5f1daebc5", "room": "TBA 2", "title": "Solving Multimodal and Long-Context Challenges", "endsAt": 1791196200000, "category": "[Deep Dive, BEGINNER, Agentic Engineering & Tooling]", "dayIndex": 1, "speakers": "[Laurent Picard]", "startsAt": 1791185400000, "phaseOfDay": "MORNING", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-05", "durationMinutes": 180, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-05T12:30:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-05T09:30:00"}'),
