production. This session introduces Spring AI, the framework that brings GenAI capabilities natively into your
Spring Boot applications.
We''ll walk through the building blocks of AI-powered applications. From conversational chat interactions to
Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), tool calling, testing, and observability, before diving into agentic AI
patterns using the Model Context Protocol (MCP).
Through hands-on examples, attendees will learn to build production-ready AI applications and agentic systems
using Spring AI.','{"id": "36921a518da04e51bff1e39deee750ba", "room": "TBA 2", "title": "Introduction to Spring AI", "endsAt": 1791199200000, "category": "[Lunch Talk, BEGINNER, Agentic Engineering & Tooling]", "dayIndex": 1, "speakers": "[Timo Salm]", "startsAt": 1791196800000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-05", "durationMinutes": 40, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-05T13:20:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-05T12:40:00"}'),
