01423645,0.00223732,-0.011909485,0.012496948,-0.018661499,-0.02468872,0.002193451,0.039489746,-0.04058838,-0.012901306,0.022018433,-0.007167816,-0.0054473877,-0.0007047653,0.021820068,0.009269714,-0.0049972534,0.0062179565,0.00484848,0.0105896,-0.0052833557,0.021408081,0.0015869141,0.031280518,0.033813477,-0.018218994,0.022521973,-0.025558472,-0.009559631,0.016998291,-0.00680542,-0.014152527,-0.03805542,0.005554199,0.02166748,0.006137848,-0.011672974,-0.022521973,0.037322998,-0.0061073303,0.009223938,0.02671814,-0.0020008087,0.07470703,0.02029419,-0.025909424,0.010597229,0.055358887,-0.012908936,0.014259338,-0.013763428,0.024337769,-0.022735596,0.013870239,0.011207581,-0.003080368,0.013656616,0.009147644,-0.009902954,-0.0096588135,-0.023864746,-0.013381958,-0.011734009,-0.029663086,0.03466797,0.027008057,0.01626587,0.0025672913,0.0236969,0.019042969,0.023880005,-0.006919861,0.051452637,-0.023513794,-0.011138916,0.009483337,-0.009651184,0.005329132,0.008529663,-0.029037476,-0.033935547,0.004055023,-0.0007853508,-0.019378662,0.06555176,0.018478394,-0.005176544,-0.0040130615,0.027740479,-0.018875122,-0.013710022,-0.013328552,-0.018356323,-0.028518677,0.006187439,-0.016098022,0.025115967,-0.050201416,-0.011627197,0.037353516,-0.002155304,0.024139404,0.023666382,0.015167236,-0.021270752,-0.033569336,-0.00315094,-0.03375244]'::public.vector,'title:Building the Trusted Agent Ecosystem, description:The industry is rapidly introducing agentic services that are accelerating the arrival of the "Agentic Web". Yet adoption is still bottlenecked by the lack of user trust. Users are understandably afraid to grant remote AI agents access to their private data or authorization tokens. To overcome this, we need robust solutions that empower all developers to create agents that users can trust.

In this session, we introduce a comprehensive framework for building the Trusted Agent Ecosystem. By leveraging Confidential Computing and Binary Transparency, we provide verifiable trust across the entire AI stack: securing MCP tools, model inference and remote agents connected via A2A. We will present our open-source implementation of the framework that leverages verifiable WebAssembly sandboxes and Confidential GPUs to build trusted agentic services.','{"id": "61e453571f644aefbb74a63ef2aa1d5b", "room": "TBA 2", "title": "Building the Trusted Agent Ecosystem", "endsAt": 1791219000000, "category": "[Tools-in-Action, INTERMEDIATE, Security, Trust & Compliance]", "dayIndex": 1, "speakers": "[Ivan Petrov, Patrick McGrath]", "startsAt": 1791217200000, "phaseOfDay": "EVENING", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-05", "durationMinutes": 30, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-05T18:50:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-05T18:20:00"}'),
