Taikai takes this concept further. It builds on ArchUnit by providing a ready-to-use collection of architectural rules for popular technologies, helping teams enforce architectural consistency and best practices effortlessly. In this session, you’ll learn how Taikai can make your architecture more testable, maintainable, and resilient from day one.','{"id": "354b52d660574dd2b77bf19fb55eae4e", "room": "TBA 3", "title": "Testing Architecture Made Simple", "endsAt": 1791219000000, "category": "[Tools-in-Action, BEGINNER, Architecture & Modernization]", "dayIndex": 1, "speakers": "[Gunter Rotsaert]", "startsAt": 1791217200000, "phaseOfDay": "EVENING", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-05", "durationMinutes": 30, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-05T18:50:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-05T18:20:00"}'),
