, ongoing challenges, and exciting new developments on the roadmap. This is your chance to ask questions, share feedback, exchange ideas, and help shape the future of LangChain4j. Come with curiosity and leave with insights, connections, and inspiration!','{"id": "60e580b2c9044f079e8bc1eca72984eb", "room": "TBA 8", "title": "LangChain4j Community BOF", "endsAt": 1791223200000, "category": "[BOF, BEGINNER, Agentic Engineering & Tooling]", "dayIndex": 1, "speakers": "[Dimitris Andreadis]", "startsAt": 1791219600000, "phaseOfDay": "EVENING", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-05", "durationMinutes": 60, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-05T20:00:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-05T19:00:00"}'),
