Fear not! In this deep dive Marit and Piotr will take their time to explain and demo the new exciting things and also show you how to use them in your IDE, so that the next day you can start having fun and profit with modern Java in your favorite tools on your own.

As a bonus you’ll also see how to improve your IDEA-fu and understand vector search with multi-modal (text & images) models.','{"id": "3dcf1646eeee456cbd7704e751754592", "room": "TBA 3", "title": "Learning modern Java the playful way", "endsAt": 1791282600000, "category": "[Deep Dive, BEGINNER, Java Language & Platform]", "dayIndex": 2, "speakers": "[Marit van Dijk, Piotr Przybyl]", "startsAt": 1791271800000, "phaseOfDay": "MORNING", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-06", "durationMinutes": 180, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-06T12:30:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-06T09:30:00"}'),
