A few month later, here we are, a functional stack with no less than15 independent modules covering the entire Core Profile and MicroProfile ! Join me in this exciting live coding session where I will introduce you to Vidocq by building from scratch a complete application using most of the available modules.

No slides, just live "human" coding and maybe a bit of vibe coding for the 5 last minutes. And the end of the session, my goal is to give you the appetite to try out this stack and helping promoting this exciting European sovereign project !','{"id": "b9ec423b27294841bc6327211f0d9d72", "room": "TBA 4", "title": "30 minutes to build your first Vidocq app, the 100% European Sovereign Java stack with zero external dependencies", "endsAt": 1791300000000, "category": "[Tools-in-Action, INTERMEDIATE, Java Language & Platform]", "dayIndex": 2, "speakers": "[Sebastien Blanc]", "startsAt": 1791298200000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-06", "durationMinutes": 30, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-06T17:20:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-06T16:50:00"}'),
