e the feedback you need to improve your agent skills & MCPs.','{"id": "2a8e7652038343e6a514cc6a2ea5291a", "room": "TBA 2", "title": "Exquisite Evals for Skills & MCPs", "endsAt": 1791305400000, "category": "[Tools-in-Action, INTERMEDIATE, Development Practices]", "dayIndex": 2, "speakers": "[Christian Tzolov, James Ward]", "startsAt": 1791303600000, "phaseOfDay": "EVENING", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-06", "durationMinutes": 30, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-06T18:50:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-06T18:20:00"}'),
