ou will learn how TuxCare solutions, from rebootless patching and end-of-life security updates to noise-free vulnerability scanning and enterprise support for community operating systems, help enterprises run open-source software with confidence – even when the calendar, the threat landscape, or upstream support say otherwise','{"id": "f4e73dbb6d4c4631b73f86f5ccc67dc8", "room": "TBA 5", "title": "Engineering for the Long Haul: Operating Open Source at Scale", "endsAt": 1791373500000, "category": "[Lunch Talk, BEGINNER, Development Practices]", "dayIndex": 3, "speakers": "[Sven Sellen]", "startsAt": 1791371100000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-07", "durationMinutes": 40, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-07T13:45:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-07T13:05:00"}'),
