This presentation explores the existential threat AI poses to the ecosystem and outlines new defensive strategies (closing the door, reorganizing the house, machine-adapted governance, etc.).','{"id": "f509e9521b50418fbcf26501d3876c59", "room": "TBA 2", "title": "Surviving the \"AI Slopageddon\": How AI shakes the foundations of Open Source", "endsAt": 1791387000000, "category": "[Conference, BEGINNER, Development Practices]", "dayIndex": 3, "speakers": "[Raphael Semeteys]", "startsAt": 1791384000000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-07", "durationMinutes": 50, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-07T17:30:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-07T16:40:00"}'),
