They are good and they are expensive!

The same underlying models can be used to write
more specialized, cheaper, more predictable AI agents.

+ Maybe you need an agent specialized for your business.
+ Or you need a cheap, disposable one for a quick and dirty task.
+ Later, you want multiple agents to collaborate.

All of that can be done with no code, leveraging Docker Agent,
an open-source project and a real Swiss Army knife for AI agent creation:

+ Create intelligent agents that solve real problems in minutes, without code.
+ Test, benchmark, and optimize agent behavior systematically through evals.
+ Build collaborative multi-agent architectures with MCP, ACP and A2A.
+ Work with any LLM provider on your own terms: frontier, local, small, large.','{"id": "91febf5718054fd9a98224f4328d5d0f", "room": "TBA 5", "title": "Create your own AI Agents without code", "endsAt": 1791391200000, "category": "[Conference, INTERMEDIATE, Agentic Engineering & Tooling]", "dayIndex": 3, "speakers": "[David Gageot]", "startsAt": 1791388200000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-07", "durationMinutes": 50, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-07T18:40:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-07T17:50:00"}'),
