s that you can use to improve the performance of your own applications.
These include:

How to set up a test system

Recommended load generators

The USE method','{"id": "6a6825ce81034dd6adda2df25c69e5c3", "room": "TBA 8", "title": "When benchmarks go bad - what we learned from measuring performance wrong", "endsAt": 1791391200000, "category": "[Conference, INTERMEDIATE, Development Practices]", "dayIndex": 3, "speakers": "[Francesco Nigro, Holly Cummins]", "startsAt": 1791388200000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-07", "durationMinutes": 50, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-07T18:40:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-07T17:50:00"}');
