In this session, a group of experienced speakers will answer these questions and more. We''ll share tips on getting started, writing proposals that get accepted, preparing your material, and delivering a great presentation. We''ll talk about what worked, what didn''t, and the lessons we learned along the way. You''ll leave with practical takeaways - and the confidence to submit your first proposal.','{"id": "ea493dc3789945508d681a65d7319f3e", "room": "TBA 11", "title": "Getting started with speaking: Your first conference talk", "endsAt": 1791395400000, "category": "[BOF, BEGINNER, People, Practices & Career]", "dayIndex": 3, "speakers": "[Bert Jan Schrijver]", "startsAt": 1791391800000, "phaseOfDay": "EVENING", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-07", "durationMinutes": 60, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-07T19:50:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-07T18:50:00"}'),
