618469,-0.037597656,-0.042816162,0.0013170242,0.033081055,-0.0011081696,0.013534546,-0.0066604614,-0.0049438477,0.007873535,0.029815674,0.04031372,0.034606934,0.0052833557,0.0036830902,0.0069465637,0.018859863,-0.022140503,0.003824234,0.005832672,0.015571594,0.043426514,-0.012512207,0.039093018,-0.017944336,-0.03366089,0.048217773,0.0031471252,0.008781433,-0.016723633,0.00021851063,0.025146484,0.0035057068,0.0026798248,-0.018722534,0.009727478,0.008087158,0.0022697449,0.017288208,0.002231598,0.04248047,-0.0027198792,-0.018630981,0.0064315796,0.03918457,-0.017120361,0.019607544,0.013381958,0.01852417,-0.011489868,0.028182983,0.0033836365,-0.0012550354,0.012191772,0.038085938,0.001461029,0.005836487,-0.01940918,0.004722595,0.005844116,-0.030090332,0.044281006,0.009124756,0.017684937,-0.0032043457,0.016448975,-0.0034542084,0.009269714,-0.0031909943,0.025619507,0.0018806458,-0.008102417,0.026489258,-0.0022773743,0.006290436,0.022216797,-0.03353882,-0.015975952,-0.01953125,-0.0019197464,-0.024658203,0.036254883,0.009155273,0.008399963,0.030883789,-0.0048294067,-0.033843994,-0.020431519,0.00015938282,-0.005241394,-0.00055360794,-0.005180359,-0.014976501,-0.0012340546,-0.03845215,-0.018661499,0.03137207,-0.042236328,0.01687622,0.025878906,-0.009124756,-0.021133423,-0.042633057,-0.014976501,-0.0047416687]'::public.vector,'title:From vibe coding to harness engineering: modernizing a regulated environment with AI, description:Migrating a banking mainframe to the cloud under fluctuating security regulations in three months seemed like an impossible mission. AI (agents, MCP tools) was the force multiplier that made it possible, but it demanded a paradigm shift. This session dissects the evolution from the illusion of vibe coding—generating code through fluid conversations—to the rigorous discipline of harness engineering.

When AI writes the code, software craftsmanship evolves. The focus is no longer on syntax, but on building safety nets. We will explore how to tame automated code generation in hostile and highly regulated environments by building relentless harnesses: Spec-Driven Development, evolutionary pipelines, and continuous validation.

Key Points
Evolution of Craftsmanship: The shift from typing code to orchestrating, limiting, and auditing systems generated by multiple sub-agents.

Harness Building: Using extreme testing (integration, test containers, environment simulation) to contain and certify the behavior of generated code.

Spec-Driven Development: The specification as a single, unbreakable contract between business, security, and AI agents.

Radical Pragmatism: How to maintain agility and design principles when the rules of the regulated environment change daily.','{"id": "1383b9fd01db401384ff24719ea3ce93", "room": "TBA 4", "title": "From vibe coding to harness engineering: modernizing a regulated environment with AI", "endsAt": 1791447600000, "category": "[Conference, INTERMEDIATE, Agentic Engineering & Tooling]", "dayIndex": 4, "speakers": "[Anyul Rivas]", "startsAt": 1791444600000, "phaseOfDay": "MORNING", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-08", "durationMinutes": 50, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T10:20:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T09:30:00"}'),
