This session explores the tension between sustainability and the other "-ilities" (maintainability, portability, availability, performance) and presents practical techniques to reduce energy use, carbon footprint, and operating costs.

You will leave the session with a concrete catalog of trade-offs you can apply to your next project.','{"id": "f9ed36f866084e7699ccc5227019b554", "room": "TBA 4", "title": "How to Architect Green Software", "endsAt": 1791451800000, "category": "[Conference, INTERMEDIATE, Architecture & Modernization]", "dayIndex": 4, "speakers": "[Ioannis Kolaxis]", "startsAt": 1791448800000, "phaseOfDay": "MORNING", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-08", "durationMinutes": 50, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T11:30:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T10:40:00"}'),
