We’ll dig into how seemingly harmless libraries can sometimes do more harm than good, and how tooling can help you spot trouble before your users do. Whether you’re using Spring Data JPA, navigating tricky transaction boundaries, or just wondering why things suddenly got slow, this session offers practical insights—and maybe a few fun facts.','{"id": "a01c9e4d275d40faadb4298585a464b5", "room": "TBA 5", "title": "When ORM Becomes OMG: Performance Pitfalls in JPA and Friends", "endsAt": 1791451800000, "category": "[Conference, INTERMEDIATE, Cloud Native, Data & Infrastructure]", "dayIndex": 4, "speakers": "[Jos Roseboom]", "startsAt": 1791448800000, "phaseOfDay": "MORNING", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-08", "durationMinutes": 50, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T11:30:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T10:40:00"}'),
