93396,-0.040374756,0.02027893,-0.0077056885,-0.034118652,-0.03100586,0.019195557,0.0036830902,-0.017333984,0.050720215,-0.017471313,-0.0121154785,0.0056114197,0.009765625,0.048187256,-0.017715454,0.04272461,0.005191803,0.011741638,0.009094238,0.004245758,-0.012992859,0.0029964447,0.008956909,0.02180481,-0.004299164,0.048217773,-0.002910614,-0.024597168,0.013046265,0.010368347,-0.026290894,-0.0021476746,-0.01184845,0.03173828,0.003025055,-0.0033283234,-0.011138916,0.027801514,-0.0037784576,0.010261536,0.009521484,0.00856781,0.040405273,0.0021400452,0.01689148,0.005203247,0.01083374,-0.025650024,0.021591187,-0.018295288,0.0021476746,-0.011543274,0.017105103,0.018630981,-0.0065460205,-0.0053901672,0.021331787,-0.0095825195,0.0022144318,-0.01197052,-0.0027675629,0.031829834,-0.027938843,0.03048706,0.028137207,0.03074646,-0.0012264252,0.031219482,0.010856628,0.027252197,0.009170532,-0.019317627,-0.02217102,0.0010929108,0.0063705444,-0.014656067,-0.019729614,0.021575928,-0.022079468,-0.028717041,-0.008201599,0.0065994263,-0.010765076,0.0107040405,-0.002368927,-0.0028305054,0.033569336,0.0009703636,0.013969421,-0.023330688,-0.016113281,-0.028411865,-0.007511139,-0.0012979507,-0.009773254,0.040618896,-0.012817383,-0.001168251,0.019851685,-0.0211792,0.02507019,0.029678345,-0.016983032,-0.011062622,-0.019714355,-0.0026893616,-0.020050049]'::public.vector,'title:"You May Now Optimize the Wedding": Optimizing the Seating, Bachelor Party, and Honeymoon with Constraint AI, description:Every developer has been there: sitting at a life event, thinking "could I automate this?" The answer is yes. And this talk will show you how.

There is a whole class of problems that AI alone cannot solve: scheduling, routing, and planning challenges where every decision affects every other decision. Timefold tackles these in production every day, across logistics, manufacturing, healthcare, and yes, apparently also weddings.

We will use the most important weekend of your life as our excuse to explore constraint optimization in practice, from seating charts to pub crawls to honeymoon itineraries, with real code, real constraints, and real solver magic.
You will leave knowing how to turn any "could I automate this?" moment into a working optimization solution.','{"id": "ece944d1830240049d9f6664febc8ee6", "room": "TBA 3", "title": "\"You May Now Optimize the Wedding\": Optimizing the Seating, Bachelor Party, and Honeymoon with Constraint AI", "endsAt": 1791459300000, "category": "[Lunch Talk, BEGINNER, Agentic Engineering & Tooling]", "dayIndex": 4, "speakers": "[Geoffrey De Smet, Tom Cools]", "startsAt": 1791456900000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-08", "durationMinutes": 40, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T13:35:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T12:55:00"}');
