At": 1791459300000, "category": "[Lunch Talk, INTERMEDIATE, Development Practices]", "dayIndex": 4, "speakers": "[Jan Boonen]", "startsAt": 1791456900000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-08", "durationMinutes": 40, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T13:35:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T12:55:00"}'),
