ord fatigue and hello to a secure, seamless login experience. Are you ready to embrace the future of authentication?','{"id": "9369851592054863b1c45c94e8e68640", "room": "TBA 7", "title": "Bootiful Security", "endsAt": 1791477000000, "category": "[Conference, BEGINNER, Security, Trust & Compliance]", "dayIndex": 4, "speakers": "[Daniel Garnier-Moiroux, Josh Long]", "startsAt": 1791474000000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-08", "durationMinutes": 50, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T18:30:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T17:40:00"}'),
