899048,-0.02935791,0.008552551,0.012145996,-0.024536133,0.001121521,-0.0027332306,0.0021705627,-0.021011353,0.0262146,0.03918457,0.015327454,-0.0042495728,0.0005226135,0.013084412,-0.016067505,-0.010276794,0.014709473,0.036590576,0.0053863525,0.04800415,-0.024871826,0.024490356,-0.021484375,-0.040252686,0.0025405884,0.0110321045,-0.035217285,-0.004737854,0.014350891,0.023422241,-0.005302429,-0.008163452,-0.011932373,0.01259613,-0.0037155151,0.0004925728,0.020599365,0.009719849,0.068603516,0.00819397,-0.0006380081,0.019058228,0.051849365,-0.029281616,0.017944336,-0.036865234,0.013061523,-0.014854431,0.014030457,0.004383087,-0.002073288,0.033843994,0.005344391,-0.009468079,-0.019088745,-0.012481689,-0.005844116,0.0072135925,0.0010032654,0.026779175,0.0076522827,0.013092041,-0.0284729,0.005794525,0.024597168,0.024307251,-0.026016235,0.010772705,-0.012924194,0.0065231323,0.004825592,-0.0038757324,-0.01637268,0.008407593,-0.022705078,-0.02458191,-0.015617371,0.0028800964,-0.009269714,0.04486084,0.031143188,-0.030227661,-0.015319824,0.0012779236,-0.019821167,-0.011993408,0.008346558,-0.023757935,-0.002445221,-0.024993896,0.005794525,0.041046143,-0.020965576,-0.02204895,0.031677246,-0.036102295,0.009994507,0.01890564,0.009361267,-0.013511658,-0.03805542,-0.0019626617,-0.014640808]'::public.vector,'title:AI in the Dark: Running LLMs in Air-Gapped Production Environments, description:Building an AI agent is easy. Building one you''d trust in production is harder. Building one that runs with no internet access, no cloud APIs, and no external services: that''s a different problem entirely.

This talk follows a real journey: taking an AI-driven service from demo to production in an air-gapped defence environment where OpenAI, Azure and others are simply not an option.

The cloud disappearing changes everything: local LLMs under real performance constraints, tool-calling without external infrastructure, hallucination you can''t fix by swapping an API, and human oversight in a system that talks to nothing outside its own network.

This is a production story from an environment where "it works on my machine" was never good enough and that''s because the machine is isolated, locked down, and the usual shortcuts don''t exist.','{"id": "040878fd9df0490ab2c3a6ceb415ac52", "room": "TBA 3", "title": "AI in the Dark: Running LLMs in Air-Gapped Production Environments", "endsAt": 1791477000000, "category": "[Conference, INTERMEDIATE, Agentic Engineering & Tooling]", "dayIndex": 4, "speakers": "[Mihaela Gheorghe-Roman]", "startsAt": 1791474000000, "phaseOfDay": "AFTERNOON", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-08", "durationMinutes": 50, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T18:30:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T17:40:00"}'),
