ive?

This is a manifesto to understand the present and imagine the future – thought-provoking, sharp, and unorthodox. It breaks with old logic and prejudices and sees in today’s disorder the seed of something better. For thinkers and doers, for citizens, entrepreneurs, and policymakers who believe that Europe can be more than an old continent in crisis.','{"id": "5fe42600d904486783c04df2ba894f83", "room": "TBA 4", "title": "F*ck The System, and other bad ideas for the future", "endsAt": 1791481200000, "category": "[Closing Keynote, BEGINNER, Agentic Engineering & Tooling]", "dayIndex": 4, "speakers": "[Jo Caudron]", "startsAt": 1791478500000, "phaseOfDay": "EVENING", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-08", "durationMinutes": 45, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T19:40:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-08T18:55:00"}'),
