In this talk I''ll speak about the motivation and challenges the team had while developing Maven 4 and of course about its new features and improvements.','{"id": "4810816293544142adcf98de34479579", "room": "TBA 5", "title": "All you need to know about Maven 4!", "endsAt": 1791534000000, "category": "[Conference, BEGINNER, Development Practices]", "dayIndex": 5, "speakers": "[Matthias Bünger]", "startsAt": 1791531000000, "phaseOfDay": "MORNING", "conferenceDay": "2026-10-09", "durationMinutes": 50, "endsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-09T10:20:00", "startsAtLocalDateTime": "2026-10-09T09:30:00"}'),
